# Sourced alongside lab-01/02/03/04. Lab 06 sources this
# file for the target group its ALBRequestCountPerTarget policy names.
#
# USMS_ALB_LISTENER_ARN was looked up with Listeners[?to_string(Port)=='80']: the lab's
# \`80\` escaping keeps its backslash inside \$( '...' ) in a heredoc (bash and zsh alike).
# USMS_SVC_GRACE_PERIOD reads None because Floci 1.7 never stores healthCheckGracePeriodSeconds
# (set to 60 on create-service and again on update-service); a known benign failure.

